title AD-02 Seller application and listing approval (UC-15, UC-16, UC-21)
|Customer|
start
:Submit seller application;
|Administrator|
:Review application;
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Grant seller role (customer role kept),\nrecord decision;
else (no)
  |System|
  :Record rejection reason;
  |Customer|
  :See rejection, may apply again;
  stop
endif
|Seller|
:Create listing with images;
|System|
:Save listing as pending;
|Administrator|
:Review listing;
if (Approve?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Set listing approved\n(visible in catalog);
else (no)
  |System|
  :Set listing rejected with reason;
  |Seller|
  :See reason, edit and resubmit;
  stop
endif
|Seller|
:Listing is on sale;
stop
@enduml
